{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間11月23日，美國總統特朗普接受美國消費者新聞與商業頻道（CNBC）節目專訪，首次公開承認自己深度介入，推動英偉達接受黃仁勳復職。談及原因時，特朗普堅稱，自己這麼做「完全是為了國家」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587838.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:23:59.619372+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:11:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:14.419575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:14.419575+00:00","content_hash":"e0cb417dd694f2d3733a4c16e29dce8aaf03f6086af49f537b90cbf11f66760f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}